# Personal files the scripts create next to themselves: logs (they include message text),
# settings tuned to your voice and mic, your "Teach it my voice" recordings, the captions' notes of
# when your messages were sent and where you cleared a chat (they include your messages' words),
# the games the captions learned, and earlier caption versions you've kept to switch back to.
*-log.txt
*.ini
*-times.txt
*-cleared.txt
*-games.txt
hey-claude-voice-samples/
captions-versions/

